#. Tag: phrase
#: calc-eqgal.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Equatorial/Galactic Coordinates"
msgstr "Ekvatorijalne/galaktičke koordinate"

#. Tag: para
#: calc-eqgal.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module converts from <link linkend=\"equatorial\">Equatorial "
"coordinates</link> to <link linkend=\"galactic\">Galactic coordinates</"
"link>, and vice versa. Fill in the coordinate values in either the "
"<guilabel>Galactic coordinates</guilabel> or <guilabel>Equatorial "
"coordinates</guilabel> section. Alternatively set the equatorial coordinates "
"by selecting an object using the <guilabel>Find Object</guilabel> dialog. "
"Then the complementary coordinates will be filled in."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul konvertuje iz <link linkend=\"equatorial\">ekvatorijalnih "
"koordinata</link> u <link linkend=\"galactic\">galaktičke koordinate</link>, "
"i nazad. Popunite vrijednosti koordinata u <guilabel>galaktičkim "
"koordinatama </guilabel> ili <guilabel>ekvatorijalnim koordinatama</"
"guilabel>. Alternativnom postavite ekvatorijalne koordinate izborom oobjekta "
"koristeći dijalog<guilabel>Nađi objekt</guilabel>. Onda če se popuniti "
"komplementarne koordinate."
